## Fix

The parser must detect locale from browser or user settings and parse dates accordingly:
- DD/MM for: en-GB, en-IE, pl-PL, it-IT, nl-NL, fr-FR, cs-CZ, da-DK, pt-PT, es-ES, de-DE
- MM/DD for: en-US (current behavior)

This is queued in the main product fix.

## Why we split

A big ticket is mostly one bug reported many times. Splitting by locale-tenant lets the desk:
- Track how many users each fix reaches
- Test fixes with the right locale settings
- Close issues as coverage expands
